@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


###
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/deployments
Accept: application/json

###

### Probe all known API versions — check logs for results
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/probe-versions
Accept: application/json

###

### Say hello to the PR-Review-Accelerator agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/hello
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat — send a custom message to the agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "What kind of issues do you look for when reviewing a pull request?"
}

###

### Chat — ask about best practices
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "What are the most important things to check in a code review?"
}

###

### Ask the agent to review pull request #1
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/review/pull-requests/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Ask the agent to review pull request #42
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/review/pull-requests/183922
Accept: application/json

